            <div xml:id="m-3c6c7c28-6e8b-4b5c-a364-5ef5831428ca">
              <lg xml:id="m-ce7e583b-5c12-4a42-a4dd-5a18aa634b7b">
                <l xml:id="m-359fdc7a-d1af-4209-b836-4d2fb957994c" facs="#m-e0a3ce8a-dfa1-4cfe-9d47-992dee0e668b" label="text-like">12834 Votive Mass of the Christ the Eternal High Priest.</l><l xml:id="m-11efa220-694f-442e-b492-b0cc59185197" facs="#m-720f20f6-5b42-43ac-9a3e-3f25dd6f428d" label="lyrics-like">in ae- térnum se¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c457bf2-29b4-4c2b-9db1-86a1f8b7d957" facs="#m-67549ece-9150-4267-a184-0795667a5be7" label="lyrics-like">é- um: Tu es sacérdos</l><l xml:id="m-45268fb0-002b-40c6-9c69-57c5a30ec479" facs="#m-dfc16395-affb-4330-92f8-5aa5125efcbf" label="lyrics-like">cún- dum órdinem Mel-chí-se-dech. P. T. Alle-lú¬ ia,</l><l xml:id="m-2c94c9db-4072-4673-b771-882dbd1f6a44" facs="#m-3acc1e7a-522a-4d01-b354-1a563ac1fb1c" label="lyrics-like">alle- lú- ia. Ps. Dí-xit Dóminus Dómino mé¬o</l><l xml:id="m-e5b679ec-81c4-45bc-867c-89786bc88056" facs="#m-540e4d4b-14bd-49cc-9c4d-912393d41200" label="lyrics-like">Sé-de a déxtris mé¬ is. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7e5adcd9-aabb-4bae-879e-f9b23f4969ac" facs="#m-46685d63-df3a-46a2-9002-9f82ad868d98" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-269d5e98-9de2-4cc9-a8f3-938b73f20d7e" facs="#m-097b96ba-872f-4006-bb30-ccfea60ad013" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui, ad majestátis tuae tros et mysteriórum suórum dispen¬</l><l xml:id="m-94b938fc-63b6-464e-ac3d-0a67dd7d9e56" facs="#m-4a1c47d4-b199-47af-b4eb-ff2d2c755fb2" label="lyrics-like">I glóriam et géneris humáni salú¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c3e323a-8e9e-46a0-979a-7fc9ff4a5e27" facs="#m-14e27aa7-7973-45b4-9cc6-c3ffd4acb78d" label="lyrics-like">satóres élégit,“in accépto mini¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ccc7f22-35eb-417e-830b-7e2b227a3b1e" facs="#m-6e4a0dd1-beb5-488f-a5a4-7ee3cf89d995" label="lyrics-like">stério adimpléndo fidéles invenián¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ba60085-76e7-45b4-8a81-5ad02777fe6b" facs="#m-e2b86a2b-ccc6-4edd-b124-c962e814c05b" label="lyrics-like">tem, Unigénitum tuum summum</l><l xml:id="m-21a27230-1ca9-4894-94a1-6cc598f6b0a3" facs="#m-17371839-b975-4d55-a14f-6b21b284ee37" label="lyrics-like">tur. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7b049878-8aca-456f-93ba-d5785e0e1a8b" facs="#m-9033d435-5937-4975-a401-0e73ce71bba3" label="lyrics-like">atque aetérnum constituísti Sacer¬</l><l xml:id="m-2fa56ffe-9915-4eab-a5e6-fb752054bf4d" facs="#m-d9b5d7b5-ebf0-438f-ab4b-dd14e451ea8e" label="lyrics-like">dótem: t praesta; ut, quos minis¬</l><l xml:id="m-6114ca62-8761-4d3a-8688-d59b9075ac34" facs="#m-dccb753f-b316-48ed-b315-559fdcbbe747" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Hebraeos. Heb. S, 1-11.</l><l xml:id="m-8f525527-2940-4812-9f14-b28b637abdd8" facs="#m-3e51ee08-aaf2-4967-81fe-34bcd12d558c" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Omnis póntifex ex loco dicit: Tu es sacérdos in</l><l xml:id="m-b3893920-a614-4453-b6df-09ecb83f2e0a" facs="#m-873ea942-9614-4847-844a-846a935fe267" label="lyrics-like">hominibus assúmptus, pro ho¬</l><l xml:id="m-47e16980-27ce-4c22-9e26-8a2a48a30879" facs="#m-d6619d61-64bb-4d57-83a0-8d4055aa40f9" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum secúndum órdinem Mel¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2c48bae-9113-4e3b-a650-d42bad67e8cd" facs="#m-48bdb3e6-e363-4bec-a5dd-54909e72934e" label="lyrics-like">chísedech. Qui in diébus carnis</l><l xml:id="m-0918fc32-aef9-499c-9b2e-ab3886d3e2ee" facs="#m-8cbe3b17-ee75-4d59-ab0b-c812a7851027" label="lyrics-like">mínibus constitúitur in iis, quae</l><l xml:id="m-ed4ba784-8bed-4eb9-a4db-6b87394ca57b" facs="#m-c57c7e41-84ea-45de-8cbd-dd914d56d4d3" label="lyrics-like">sunt ad Deum, ut ófferat dona, et</l><l xml:id="m-c6f705cf-08ff-4dd7-9e58-3a2c41087381" facs="#m-2e2279ce-9ef4-42c0-8188-600d85ce709e" label="lyrics-like">suae preces supplicationésque ad</l><l xml:id="m-cffc6cc8-1ff4-4341-b305-500afc3618bb" facs="#m-b0fa0779-21d6-46c2-906e-7847e3a40e12" label="lyrics-like">sacrifícia pro peccátis: qui condo¬</l><l xml:id="m-62df923e-9928-488b-8180-541731bccca8" facs="#m-bfd54303-0c94-4d60-bb53-e4e3f12953ff" label="lyrics-like">eum, qui possit illum salvum fácere</l><l xml:id="m-d8ef5edd-398d-49d0-8d72-44d0f0c6fb89" facs="#m-09d3dd41-5b31-406d-98d7-c7e5d6606374" label="lyrics-like">a morte, cum clamóre válido et</l><l xml:id="m-8501a3d8-afad-46cb-8beb-f38c33430c27" facs="#m-20100aae-4c75-4945-8fb9-0ce167da3ff5" label="lyrics-like">lére possit iis, qui ignórant, et</l><l xml:id="m-92c050c2-b5d1-493f-9ace-c9d715f53263" facs="#m-ea1c43b6-6cf2-4ebf-96c9-43ab41c32431" label="lyrics-like">lácrymis ófferens, exaudítus est pro</l><l xml:id="m-2e37cebc-c84d-4c1b-b15b-d1ec49833463" facs="#m-87c33db6-c8d0-40d0-b79c-752caec19537" label="lyrics-like">errant: quóniam etipse circúmdatus</l><l xml:id="m-73b136ba-10a6-4d41-89ec-0f7866c07eb5" facs="#m-0b038008-e68e-4b90-ade9-b3e8eb801ac3" label="lyrics-like">sua reveréntia. Et quidem, cum</l><l xml:id="m-4c80f80f-79a1-4bad-9370-e647968b4db1" facs="#m-415667cb-9cb1-46b3-9a85-dbf9aee7efdf" label="lyrics-like">est infirmitáte: et proptérea debet,</l><l xml:id="m-74880090-10b0-494e-aab5-e7938adc72b7" facs="#m-c647ec88-f8e9-4049-b029-96fdeb9e08a2" label="ambiguous">esset Filius Dei, didicit ex iis, quae</l><l xml:id="m-14ea8e1f-b2ae-4d8e-a851-37b5514a3520" facs="#m-9e3cf2b8-7e0f-4d52-887c-ecf634bcf5ce" label="lyrics-like">quemádmodum pro pópulo, ita</l><l xml:id="m-5d1d90b9-56c6-4db4-bd74-d18ce7cc3060" facs="#m-b2c7078c-082e-43b6-9a4c-b424d8dc461b" label="lyrics-like">passus est, obediéntiam: et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-70ee2ff5-1620-47b6-946b-54c7bfd55e7d" facs="#m-6fd01c71-57bb-4827-b189-2e668501a182" label="lyrics-like">étiam et pro semetípso offérre pro</l><l xml:id="m-919646cd-3b07-4f7b-a776-5dc7c7a336db" facs="#m-277b1cde-9597-4f5f-ac43-e048ba04816d" label="lyrics-like">summátus, factus est ómnibus ob¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3244b48-2e50-4144-a7dd-0cd861db5f0c" facs="#m-436f9b78-ba0e-4cba-b7f9-07437f30f0b1" label="lyrics-like">peccátis. Nec quisquam sumit sibi</l><l xml:id="m-46be8ab5-cd89-45d0-a15a-b7830c169162" facs="#m-fb2e82b5-4420-47fc-814f-141b19db76fd" label="lyrics-like">temperántibus sibi, causa salútis</l><l xml:id="m-0580cbe1-542b-496b-ae3e-a57f898047d8" facs="#m-97fdf173-afe9-40cd-87c9-5dc747cc9fad" label="lyrics-like">honórem, sed qui vocátur a Deo,</l><l xml:id="m-82b70269-0c1e-4846-b1ff-d9f068db846e" facs="#m-944efa1d-cc57-4df8-a5ac-0b4a9b850b64" label="lyrics-like">aetérnae, appellátus a Deo póntifex</l><l xml:id="m-c64d1638-7356-42a3-8e7c-86276ea12b1e" facs="#m-42ad3431-a5c6-47b9-a0c9-ef98536a73aa" label="ambiguous">tamquam Aaron. Sic et Christus</l><l xml:id="m-cb11c6a3-c968-4334-be7b-e81f4fe9e8ab" facs="#m-ba55625a-2ad6-4bbd-9d54-f6b79324fcb3" label="lyrics-like">juxta órdinem Melchísedech. De</l><l xml:id="m-f3fee6ce-db6c-4021-b064-2866eed6072c" facs="#m-7b7d88e3-07da-4d12-a617-5adb4b7e254e" label="lyrics-like">non semetípsum clarificávit ut pón¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7d5cfde-2db8-4952-a9a6-2b42bf002d3f" facs="#m-6115a32b-65e5-4fd9-86fa-6d8e1b42644e" label="lyrics-like">tifex fieret, sed qui locútus est ad</l><l xml:id="m-2257de41-3e35-4a05-92ca-bc26277d9647" facs="#m-fe8fb75d-dc8f-44a4-8b5e-7b5811e319cc" label="ambiguous">quo nobis grandis sermo, et inin¬</l><l xml:id="m-f6df1ff1-0c64-47c6-bf8f-45f0fc5aee78" facs="#m-6b3cfc4a-22d3-42f1-a52b-91258cf05bb1" label="lyrics-like">terpretábilis ad dicéndum.</l><l xml:id="m-36a0092f-e04c-41d6-ae85-172e0feb45e3" facs="#m-57aead85-01f6-44d6-afba-2c754d8d4c56" label="lyrics-like">eum: Filius meus es tu; ego hódie</l><l xml:id="m-140c999a-5bf6-4702-ba84-3791b118ff58" facs="#m-3fc72715-178a-444a-86cb-725da0618056" label="lyrics-like">génui te. Quemádmodum et in álio</l><l xml:id="m-e072d113-563f-47e7-870e-edb81a2314b7" facs="#m-08e466fc-f6d3-411a-b7ab-d8063253e942" label="ambiguous">"</l><l xml:id="m-51b52fad-03e7-49df-81b6-992169c5b76f" facs="#m-5d365c4b-f5ac-4c45-a163-318934851269" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-1ef97437-b1d6-4c8e-af97-d9fdcce590c8" facs="#m-47a2a197-b90b-490e-97ae-6c32944767b3" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-077e0817-04b1-4741-9ff0-1a804ebc330d" facs="#m-73f63ba2-a5bb-449e-a761-50641953a535" label="lyrics-like">Pí-ri-tus Dó-mi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-90ee322e-8a25-491a-b5cd-fe31474dc0f3" facs="#m-8a02f9de-9da4-4a80-9c3c-11aa651780ed" label="ambiguous">su- per me,</l><l xml:id="m-5a71997f-5b58-4aaa-8a38-c895fe9fd1a7" facs="#m-254c4d45-d081-4a9e-90c7-4da0ee08a7f6" label="ambiguous">pro¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>